{"unit_id":"YanKaFei__Lacan-Knowledge-OS#card-zh","repo":"YanKaFei/Lacan-Knowledge-OS","commit":"e17536da0993e72d7492d6e70a5570883d093c80","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Lacan Knowledge OS 是一个面向 DSH 和其他 MCP 客户端的拉康研究工具与工作台。它通过 DSH bundle 将本地 MCP 服务接入会话，提供基于语料的研究问答、段落检索与上下文查看、概念和研讨班查询以及来源追溯；独立工作台还提供研究、探索和证据检查界面。研究回答携带引用与来源信息，语料证据不足时可返回弃答。适合需要围绕拉康文本检索和核对证据的研究者。MCP 默认使用 mock provider；选择真实 LLM provider 时需配置相应凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:1","cordis.patch.yml:16","mcp_server/schemas.py:78","mcp_server/tools.py:120"]}
{"unit_id":"YanKaFei__Lacan-Knowledge-OS#card-en","repo":"YanKaFei/Lacan-Knowledge-OS","commit":"e17536da0993e72d7492d6e70a5570883d093c80","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Lacan Knowledge OS connects a local MCP server to DSH for corpus-based research, passage search, context lookup, concept lookup, and source tracing. Answers include citations and may abstain when evidence is lacking. It defaults to mock; real LLM use needs credentials.","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:1","cordis.patch.yml:16","mcp_server/schemas.py:78","mcp_server/tools.py:120"]}
