{"unit_id":"YanKaFei__Lacan-Knowledge-OS#feature-1","repo":"YanKaFei/Lacan-Knowledge-OS","commit":"e17536da0993e72d7492d6e70a5570883d093c80","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Lacan Knowledge OS 的功能「语料研究问答」：通过 MCP 研究入口提交拉康或精神分析问题，服务使用本地语料返回带验证主张和引用的研究结果；无足够语料依据时可弃答。","source":"generated","evidence":["mcp_server/schemas.py:78","mcp_server/tools.py:120"]}
{"unit_id":"YanKaFei__Lacan-Knowledge-OS#feature-2","repo":"YanKaFei/Lacan-Knowledge-OS","commit":"e17536da0993e72d7492d6e70a5570883d093c80","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Lacan Knowledge OS 的功能「段落检索与语境」：调用搜索工具输入查询词并可附研讨班、语言或概念过滤；结果包含段落标识和片段，还可按段落 ID 获取原文及邻近上下文。","source":"generated","evidence":["mcp_server/schemas.py:94","mcp_server/schemas.py:125","mcp_server/schemas.py:138"]}
{"unit_id":"YanKaFei__Lacan-Knowledge-OS#feature-3","repo":"YanKaFei/Lacan-Knowledge-OS","commit":"e17536da0993e72d7492d6e70a5570883d093c80","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Lacan Knowledge OS 的功能「概念与研讨班查询」：调用对应 MCP 工具并提供概念或研讨班 ID，可查看规范概念记录、关系和术语，或研讨班的年份、课程与段落信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["mcp_server/schemas.py:156","mcp_server/schemas.py:169"]}
{"unit_id":"YanKaFei__Lacan-Knowledge-OS#feature-4","repo":"YanKaFei/Lacan-Knowledge-OS","commit":"e17536da0993e72d7492d6e70a5570883d093c80","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Lacan Knowledge OS 的功能「术语比较」：提供两个术语作为参数，专门研究入口将比较问题交给同一研究核心处理，并要求比较双方分别有语料证据。","source":"generated","evidence":["mcp_server/schemas.py:197"]}
{"unit_id":"YanKaFei__Lacan-Knowledge-OS#feature-5","repo":"YanKaFei/Lacan-Knowledge-OS","commit":"e17536da0993e72d7492d6e70a5570883d093c80","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Lacan Knowledge OS 的功能「来源追溯」：输入段落 ID 调用来源追踪工具，查看文本见证、语料来源和段落实现之间的溯源链及其完整状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["mcp_server/schemas.py:183","mcp_server/tools.py:120"]}
